WEBVTT

00:11:29.807 --> 00:11:32.786
prisons are administered in our name
and on our behalf.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.531
The conditions in ADX
implicate our tax dollars,

00:11:36.555 --> 00:11:38.039
public safety

00:11:38.063 --> 00:11:39.253
and, most of all,

00:11:39.277 --> 00:11:42.587
our shared belief in the inherent dignity
of every human being.

00:11:43.881 --> 00:11:46.266
We have an obligation to bear witness.

00:11:47.079 --> 00:11:48.238
Thank you.

00:11:48.262 --> 00:11:54.523
(Applause)